  "description": "Whilst we're always interested in new developments, fresh thinking and the next wonder material, it's well known that we love steel.\n\nIts superb strength to weight ratio, its stiffness it's ride quality. It is timeless.\n\nThis Croix De Fer frameset sees the return of Reynolds 931 stainless steel to the lineup. A superbly stiff material giving a unique spring to your pedal stroke. 931 is also incredibly corrosion resistant.\n\nA tapered head tube adds further stiffness to the front end whilst a threaded T47 bottom bracket shell increases surface area allowing for lighter tubes whilst opening up chainset compatibility.\n\nThe Croix De Fer 931 frameset is a superb base for a dream gravel build.",
